(7571327, 1215305, 59737, '<td valign="top">Looks like Vivo City in Singapore, could be any shopping mall I guess.  Nice motion blur and escalators are symmetrical when shot from a different angle so I think this works well for the challenge.  There''s not much in the way of shadows in the image and feel it could use a little more darkness to balance it out.</td>', 'Looks like Vivo City in Singapore, could be any shopping mall I guess.  Nice motion blur and escalators are symmetrical when shot from a different angle so I think this works well for the challenge.  There''s not much in the way of shadows in the image and feel it could use a little more darkness to balance it out.', '2018-06-12 17:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
